#: ../../source/guides/formats/advanced/structured.md:17
msgid ""
"**A directory a repository does not need is a file it does not have.** "
"Four of the five were added after the first, each when the same reading "
"turned out to be the majority way of reading its datum — which is the "
"condition for a datum to belong to this level at all."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/formats/advanced/structured.md:21
msgid ""
"Every directory a repository does have carries a `partial_pipes.csv` "
"beside its arguments, saying which segments each pipe builds (see "
"[Partial pipelines](#partial-pipelines)). A required cell is required "
"while the segment that reads it is built."
